# A Pilot Study Using an Online, Experimental, Two-Asset Market.

**Authors:** Lypny, Gregory

## Abstract
Describes an online, securities market, research tool, called Borsa, to engage students in the exploration of asset pricing in microeconomics courses. Defines Borsa as related database files served on the Internet using a dedicated IP address. Discusses practical considerations in running the market. Offers questions that arise from using the tool. (JEH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ679947

